    "detailed_description": "A full, action-packed adventure awaits with over 60 levels, 7 troublesome bosses, an inspiring storyline, and unique controls - there's no other game like it!<br />\r\nShukuchi literally translated means shrink earth method, to travel at great speed, an ability that our hero has perfected over years of training. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nTake control of the Shukuchi Ninja in this 2D action-platformer and fly through the air at astonishing speed, attack enemies with your ninjat\u014d, throw shuriken (ninja stars) at hard to reach enemies, and instantly teleport to quickly counter enemy attacks. With the power of healing, you must also aid the Shukuchi Ninja to ensure he doesn\u2019t die!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nJourney through ancient Japan as the Shukuchi Ninja, exiled from his former clan for wanting a more honorable way of life. Travel through vast areas defeating the Shukuchi Ninja\u2019s newfound foe to bring peace and prosperity in a time of turmoil.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures:<br />\r\n- Beautiful modern pixel art graphics<br />\r\n- Fully composed, traditional Japanese music with modern elements<br />\r\n- Over 60 levels and 7 bosses<br />\r\n- Fast paced gameplay<br />\r\n- Unique controls",
    "about_the_game": "A full, action-packed adventure awaits with over 60 levels, 7 troublesome bosses, an inspiring storyline, and unique controls - there's no other game like it!<br />\r\nShukuchi literally translated means shrink earth method, to travel at great speed, an ability that our hero has perfected over years of training. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nTake control of the Shukuchi Ninja in this 2D action-platformer and fly through the air at astonishing speed, attack enemies with your ninjat\u014d, throw shuriken (ninja stars) at hard to reach enemies, and instantly teleport to quickly counter enemy attacks. With the power of healing, you must also aid the Shukuchi Ninja to ensure he doesn\u2019t die!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nJourney through ancient Japan as the Shukuchi Ninja, exiled from his former clan for wanting a more honorable way of life. Travel through vast areas defeating the Shukuchi Ninja\u2019s newfound foe to bring peace and prosperity in a time of turmoil.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures:<br />\r\n- Beautiful modern pixel art graphics<br />\r\n- Fully composed, traditional Japanese music with modern elements<br />\r\n- Over 60 levels and 7 bosses<br />\r\n- Fast paced gameplay<br />\r\n- Unique controls",
    "short_description": "Shukuchi Ninja is a fast-paced, high intensity arcade game with unique controls",
